{"id":404300202,"chapter_id":50088,"scene_id":58803,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"选项B-隐瞒身份","style":30,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"content":"再次进入希露妲的意识空间，这回你吸取了教训，编造了一个她能够接受的身份。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"在编造了自己是如何“作为宗主城联军的一员潜入了狄斯监狱中”的故事后，你终于说出了自己的目的。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"局长","content":"……所以，我需要你的记忆，包括“磐石”的帮助，一起对抗狄斯。","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"希露妲","content":"……","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"希露妲","content":"你是说，战争……还在继续吗？","voice":["vo_event_404300202_08"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_43003","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"content":"你点头。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"speaker":"局长","content":"孩子最需要父母的支持。","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"局长","content":"你的头脑、你的发明对战局很重要。而我是你现在能够逃离狄斯控制的唯一希望。","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"希露妲","content":"……","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"content":"她沉默了，周围漆黑的狂厄不安地涌动起来。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"content":"你静静地等待着。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"speaker":"希露妲","content":"我的记忆已经支离破碎。剩下的也就只有这一处还没有消失……","voice":["vo_event_404300202_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_43003","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"希露妲","content":"如果……这片破碎之地真有你想要的东西，或许也就只有这里了……","voice":["vo_event_404300202_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_43003","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"content":"伴随着她的手势，周围的污泥不断翻滚，吐出了原本被埋藏在这片黑暗空间中的砖石瓦砾，山石花草，日月星辰。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"content":"在废墟拔地而起的轰鸣声中，希露妲的声音却很清晰。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"speaker":"希露妲","content":"你知道自己将会面对什么吗？","voice":["vo_event_404300202_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_43003","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"speaker":"局长","content":"无论是什么，只要是为了城邦，我都愿意前往。","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"speaker":"希露妲","content":"那就……一起去吧。","voice":["vo_event_404300202_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_43003","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"content":"——去往那个无法逃脱的暴风雨之夜。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1}]}